<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="trainer-ble-test" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
  <metadata>
    <name>Fremont to Issaquah: Burke-Gilman, Sammamish River and East Lake Sammamish Trails (37 mi)</name>
    <desc>Seattle to Issaquah, WA: from the Google office on N 34th St in Fremont along the Burke-Gilman Trail past the University of Washington and Kenmore, the Sammamish River Trail through Woodinville and Redmond to Marymoor Park, then the East Lake Sammamish Trail to Issaquah. Mostly flat. Trail geometry: OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Elevation: AWS Terrain Tiles (Terrarium, z15), smoothed.</desc>
    <copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/</license></copyright>
  </metadata>
